codex
The implementation has the requested hooks, but some are weaker than the design asks for: several paths stamp activities as journaled even when no durable journal effect was created, and snapshot flow sign handling appears inconsistent with the helper it defines. I’m reading specs now to separate “known gap with no test” from “test asserts the wrong behavior.”
