codex
The tests cover the happy versions of the requested scenarios, but they miss several edge cases the design explicitly called out: type-first flow normalization, sell exceeding a plug, same-day timestamp ambiguity, bootstrapped closed-before-review stats, and missing corporate-action halves. I’ll verify those against the underlying implementation before writing the review.
